      "sha": "10615cce5019acefd625c1300cba85d228b045cc",
      "message": "breaking: make pagination mandatory - default to first page (#13960)\n\nThe page and limit parameters to many Forgejo APIs have previously been optional, and if not provided have been interpreted as \"retrieve all data\". Forgejo will now default page to 1, and default limit to [api].DEFAULT_PAGING_NUM (default: 30).\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13960\nReviewed-by: Mathieu Fenniak <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
